    any other files.

1.2 "Personal Use" means use of the Work by a natural person for personal study, research or
    their own affairs, and not for the business purposes of any organization they belong to.

1.3 "Internal Business Use" means use of the Work by an organization (whether or not operated
    for profit) for its OWN business operations, including internal office work, internal
    finance and accounting, internal management and reporting, internal system integration,
    and modifications and deployment made for such internal purposes, as well as development
    and maintenance performed by its staff or contractors solely for the organization's own
    use. Use by an entity directly or indirectly controlled by that organization is treated
    as Internal Business Use. For the purposes of this License, Internal Business Use does
    NOT constitute Resale.

1.4 "Resale" means any act of obtaining money or other economic benefit, directly or
    indirectly, from the Work, including without limitation:
    (a) selling, renting, licensing or distributing the Work or a modified version for a fee;
    (b) incorporating the Work or a modified version into any product, service, subscription
        or usage-based offering that is charged for;
    (c) providing hosted, SaaS, managed-operation or paid implementation/consulting/training
        services based on the Work;
    (d) bundling the Work or a modified version into paid courses, paid communities, paid
        installers or any other paid deliverables;
    (e) USING THE WORK TO PROVIDE SERVICES, DELIVERABLES OR REPORTS TO ANY THIRD PARTY FOR A
        FEE, including without limitation outsourced bookkeeping or accounting services,
        delivering financial, tax or business analysis to clients, or providing the output
        of the Work to clients;
    (f) removing, replacing, obscuring or altering the copyright notice, source attribution
        or this License text before further distribution.

1.5 THE SOLE TEST: the distinction between "Internal Business Use" and "Resale" under this
    License is whether the user delivers deliverables or provides services, by means of the
    Work, to a third party outside that organization. Use solely for the organization's own
    business operations is Internal Business Use; once deliverables or services are provided
    to a third party, it is Resale and requires separate authorization.

